---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Shipping Policy' }];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Shipping Policy | The Volleyball Uniforms"
  description="Free tracked shipping on every US order. Custom volleyball uniforms are made in 10–14 business days after design approval and arrive in 2–5 business days."
  canonical="https://thevolleyballuniforms.com/shipping-policy/"
>
  <div class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4"><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} /></div>
  </div>

  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-navy-950 mb-3">Shipping Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: October 26, 2026</p>

      <div class="prose-custom">
        <p>Every order from The Volleyball Uniforms is made to order for your team. This page explains where we ship, what shipping costs and how long an order takes from design approval to your door.</p>

        <h2>1. Where We Ship</h2>
        <p>We are based in New York and ship to addresses in the United States (all 50 states), the United Kingdom, Canada and Australia. Orders can go to a school, club or home address, whichever suits your team. For delivery to any other country, <a href="/request-a-quote/">request a quote</a> with your country and we confirm the shipping cost before you order.</p>

        <h2>2. Shipping Cost</h2>
        <p>Shipping is free on every order delivered to the United States, the United Kingdom, Canada or Australia. The price shown on the product page and at checkout already includes it, with no minimum order value. Prices are in US dollars. For orders outside the United States, any import duties or taxes charged by your country are paid by the recipient on delivery.</p>

        <h2>3. Production Time</h2>
        <p>Production starts after you approve your design mockup and pay the PayPal invoice we send at that point.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Standard production: 10–14 business days after approval</li>
          <li>Rush production: 5–7 business days after approval, when you ask for it before approving the design</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Delivery Time</h2>
        <p>Orders ship by tracked courier. After dispatch, delivery usually takes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>United States: 2–5 business days</li>
          <li>United Kingdom, Canada and Australia: 5–10 business days</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Very large orders may travel by freight. Delivery times are estimates; we are not responsible for carrier delays once a package is in transit.</p>

        <h2>5. Tracking</h2>
        <p>You receive tracking details by email as soon as your order leaves our facility. Orders arrive sorted and labeled by player name or number.</p>

        <h2>6. Address Accuracy</h2>
        <p>Please check the delivery address before you approve your design. If a package is returned because of an incorrect or incomplete address, we contact you to arrange delivery again.</p>

        <h2>7. Damaged or Missing Packages</h2>
        <p>If your order arrives damaged or a package is marked delivered but has not reached you, tell us within 7 days of delivery with photos where possible. See our <a href="/refund-policy/">refund policy</a> for how we put it right.</p>

        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about shipping: <a href="mailto:Info@thevolleyballuniforms.com">Info@thevolleyballuniforms.com</a> or <a href="tel:+12134493746">+1 213-449-3746</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
